<mjml lang="fr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Finalisez votre réservation Memoria</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Un paiement est attendu pour confirmer votre réservation.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./_tete.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#0b0b0b" width="600px">
    <mj-include path="./_entete.mjml" />
    <mj-wrapper background-color="#141111" border-top="3px solid #8a1316" padding="0">
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="titre">FINALISEZ VOTRE RÉSERVATION</mj-text>
          <mj-divider border-color="#a9851a" border-width="1px" width="70px" padding="6px 0 24px" />
          <mj-text>Bonjour {{var:order.customer.user.name.given_name:""}},</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="12px 32px 0">Pour confirmer votre réservation, il ne reste plus qu’à régler le montant ci-dessous par le lien de paiement sécurisé.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="0 32px 22px">
        <mj-column background-color="#1a1515" padding="18px 22px">
          <mj-text padding="0" font-size="16px" line-height="1.7"><span class="libelle">Commande</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:order.reference:""}}<br><span class="libelle">Montant</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{var:paymentAmountFormatted:""}}</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="0 0 6px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-button href="{{var:widgetPaymentLink}}" padding="0 32px 6px" align="left">Procéder au paiement</mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="10px 0 34px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>Une question ? Appelez-nous au <a href="tel:+33665718707">06&nbsp;65&nbsp;71&nbsp;87&nbsp;07</a> ou écrivez-nous à <a href="mailto:contact@memoria-experience.fr">contact@memoria-experience.fr</a>.</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="12px 32px 0" font-family="Metamorphous, Georgia, serif" color="#ece6da">L’équipe Memoria</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
    </mj-wrapper>
    <mj-include path="./_pied.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
